The '''Murderlover''' is a type of [[Mob]] and [[Goblin (disambiguation)|Goblin]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Murderlovers''' spawn during [[Goblin Raid]]s in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, as well as in the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}} of the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} in certain structures.

