== Behavior ==
'''Murderlovers''' attack the player from a distance using a fishing rod, dealing high amounts of {{Stat|damage}} on impact. They also strafe sideways to avoid being hit as easily. They cannot be attacked from players with less than {{Stat|effective health|1,500}}.

